      "side": 1,
      "message": "Those input/output capabilities are from remote PACS. Let me explain the flow.\n\n1. the sink pacs are passed from here all the way to Java InputCodecsSelectableCapabilities. \n\nhttps://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/bta/le_audio/client.cc;l\u003d3170?q\u003dSendAudioGroupSelectableCodecConfigChanged\u0026ct\u003dos\u0026sq\u003drepo:googleplex-android%2Fplatform%2Fsuperproject%2Fmain%20branch:main\n\n2. then at this logic part, we will check the sink\u0027s pacs(input/output capabilities) and update the codec config for the source\n\n3. in broadcaster.cc, we will check the adsp capabilities and decide the final capability for broadcaster(source).",
